	(text "Pin plan: PB6/7 ROM+runtime I2C; PA6 SYNC; PA7 gate; PA0/PA3 current ADCs; PA1 voltage; PA2 relay.\nPA11/12 reserved: ROM USART mapping. Unused pins marked NC; configure analog/input as appropriate.\nDriver receiver-local off biases remain on heater sheet. SYNC source must drive all receiver pull-downs." (at 15.24 180.34 0) (effects (font (size 1.05 1.05)) (justify left top)) (uuid "dc20468f-a4de-5ee0-973c-d8d590f6cfa0"))
	(text "Factory 96-bit UID; identity is not the runtime address. IWDG uses independent clock: refresh only after critical-work progress.\nWatchdog reset and loader/high-Z states require actuator OFF; hardware bias remains effective without application initialization.\n32KB space plan only: dispatcher + A/B small images/config/selector; actual <=10KB app fit and power-loss behavior UNVERIFIED.\nBOOT options must enable pin-driven recovery (NBOOT_SEL=0, NBOOT1=1, BOOT_LOCK=0, reset enabled); exclude RDP2.\nOption-byte updates remain an unresolved MOT-STOR-001 qualification item. No routing or firmware implementation is claimed." (at 15.24 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 0.95 0.95)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ea3792b3-7796-58d0-a530-93d5b3f47391"))
